r $I(x)$ using the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x) & =e^{\\int P(x)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{\\int \\left(- \\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply our differential equation through by $I(x)=e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\cdot y\\right) & =\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(- 4 e^{- x}\\right) \\\\ \\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot y & =\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(- 4 e^{- x}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we rewrite the left hand side as $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(y\\cdot I(x)):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\right) & =\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(- 4 e^{- x}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186671106 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "288156d7-fbae-55ec-bd81-8d26b011bb58" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{3 x}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671087} {:answer/id #uuid "37fd9fa0-313a-5948-869a-7bb48ef556ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{\\frac{8 x}{3}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{\\frac{8 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{3 x}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671090} {:answer/id #uuid "72a10986-6814-5106-93f8-07b882b726b2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{\\frac{4 x}{3}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{\\frac{4 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{3 x}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17