\left(3\\right)\\cdot y\\right) & =\\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{3 x}\\right) \\\\ \\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(3\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\cdot y & =\\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{3 x}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we rewrite the left hand side as $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(y\\cdot I(x)):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\right) & =\\left(e^{- 3 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{3 x}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186671126 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ab2c6c3-7851-555f-8fb3-cedb37d3d3cf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{3 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671119} {:answer/id #uuid "2fae91e1-b076-5fcc-9dd0-0ed660bb126d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{5 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671127} {:answer/id #uuid "458dee71-46fb-5f60-bbfe-dd95564739be" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{4 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671133} {:answer/id #uuid "501623ce-6c89-50cc-9bf7-55613fc8d061" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671136}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "501623ce-6c89-50cc-9bf7-55613fc8d061" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671136} :answer-field/id #uuid "1fd03680-137b-5658-8661-48a69c356b78" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671123} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5a6a7d93-672d-588a-af72-5f288893e4fb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 + 12 e^{- x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671139} {:answer/id #uuid "634f1223-5836-5e72-b571-55fc0e61dd4b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 - 12 e^{- x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671144} {:answer/id #uuid "be61dcca-c20f-59c8-b32b-197eaa09ea35" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 - 12 e^{- 5 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671162} {:answer/id #uuid "dc52c831-c5e9-51c7-9585-b1bd03cb3d51" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7 - 13 e^{- x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671166} {:answer/id #uuid "e7c36cee-b033-54ff-a40d-732c813d9bdd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 + 12 e^{- 5 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671171}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "634f1223-5836-5e72-b571-55fc0e61dd4b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 - 12 e^{- x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671144} :answer-field/id #uuid "394794f2-0640-5017-a3b6-371d2f2b6119" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671132}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "2be7fd07-ba52-508f-89b0-10b9de9cd5dc" :question/problem "Consider the following initial value problem.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\left(1\\right)y=6,\\quad y(0)=-6\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options below.\n\nAn integrating factor for this equation is $I(x)=$ {{field-1}}.\n\nThe solution to the initial value problem is $y(x)=$ {{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "This equation is in the standard form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x),\n$$\n\nwith $P(x)=1$ and $Q(x)=6.$\n\nWe compute an integrating factor using the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x) & =e^{\\int P(x)\\,\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =e^{\\int 1\\,\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =e^{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides of the equation in standard form by $I(x)=e^{x}$ yields\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}e^{x}\\cdot (\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+1y) & =e^{x}\\cdot 6 \\\\ e^{x}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+e^{x}y & =6 e^{x} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(ye^{x}) & =6 e^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(ye^{x})\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 6 e^{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ ye^{x} & =6\\left(1 e^{x}\\right)+C \\\\ ye^{x} & =6 e^{x}+C \\\\ y & =\\left(C + 6 e^{x}\\right) e^{- x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the general solution. To find the value of $C$ corresponding to the specific solution, we apply the initial condition $y(0)=-6$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) & =\\frac{(6 e^{(0)})+C}{(e^{(0)})} \\\\ -6 & =\\frac{6+C}{1} \\\\ C & =-12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=6 - 12 e^{- x}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186671131 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2471f55a-5dcd-50f3-a7a3-5c3595022a7a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4 - 5 e^{- 6 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671125} {:answer/id #uuid "376767b5-8ee9-5d21-9c2f-0443cc53d57f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4 - 5 e^{- 4 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671130} {:answer/id #uuid "61fd7d7d-68fe-56ae-9d9b-f7bef95b7e5b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4 + 5 e^{- 4 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671143} {:answer/id #uuid "bcc72dd0-27c7-5c31-8ec6-d81e03a54461" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4 + 5 e^{- 6 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671161} {:answer/id #uuid "da95e9f5-3a29-556f-b579-76fed73e87e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5 - 6 e^{- 6 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671165}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #u